    {
      "id": "claim_87ace407020e49379e28484b73830e5f",
      "statement": "VCR cassettes are stored as gzip-compressed YAML files in tests/cassettes/ directories. The CustomSerializer uses yaml.safe_load/safe_dump for secure parsing, gzip compression for file size reduction, and _coerce_bytesio() to handle io.BytesIO objects from multipart uploads. The CustomPersister manages load/save operations using CassetteNotFoundError handling.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/standard-tests/langchain_tests/conftest.py#L47-L118",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e63a80f6354bc599bba44086b63a5cc758e4f97c4982f219091da42ecb785266:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c17bbdb146af47c6abe592ee5f3dde49",
      "statement": "The base_vcr_config() function in langchain_tests.conftest defines default VCR settings: record_mode='once' (record if missing, replay if exists), filter_headers with base filters for authorization/x-api-key/api-key, match_on=['method', 'uri', 'body'] for request matching, allow_playback_repeats=True, decode_compressed_response=True, and cassette_library_dir='tests/cassettes'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/standard-tests/langchain_tests/conftest.py#L130-L155",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e3d0704dff8fca8d0a61d64b2b6b1bd421654204ab5faef64b64dd5b52df2ddf:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3fca81158aec4a298bef9df56cc2319d",
      "statement": "SandboxIntegrationTests tests implementations of deepagents.backends.protocol.SandboxBackendProtocol, an abstraction for isolated code execution. Standard tests verify file operations (write, read, edit, ls, glob, grep), upload/download roundtrips with byte integrity, command execution with large output handling, and error conditions (file_not_found, permission_denied, invalid_path). Implementations must provide a sandbox fixture that yields a clean SandboxBackendProtocol instance.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/standard-tests/langchain_tests/integration_tests/__init__.py#L42-L45",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:edd1e40e7ca7cb9f5bee632d4a1169a88b05b7e9960b53e4f317a558d956d6ca:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/standard-tests/langchain_tests/integration_tests/sandboxes.py#L1-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:597160d0a0812c56b00480e728557b62500ff7b523623dfa82578a8ab851930b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3db27544a4c34d3baa9ac938a8b5f465",
      "statement": "SandboxBackendProtocol file operations include: write(path, content) for creating new files with parent directory auto-creation, read(path) returning ReadResult with base64-encoded binary content (512 KiB preview limit), edit(path, old_text, new_text) for single-occurrence text replacement, ls(directory) for directory listing, glob(pattern, path) for pattern matching, and grep(text, path) for literal text search. Paths must be absolute; relative paths return invalid_path error.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://libs/standard-tests/langchain_tests/integration_tests/sandboxes.py#L130-L215",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a3ecd02b49a93d26f4b29cbc41747826598b9103768e817138542989636a0268:"
        },
        {
