    {
      "id": "claim_3701231973904c92913216cfadc2496f",
      "statement": "SandboxBackendProtocol execute(command_string) runs shell commands and returns ExecuteResponse with exit_code, output (stdout+stderr combined), and truncated flag. Large output (~500 KiB+) is handled; deepagents.backends.CompositeBackend can offload over-budget results to artifacts_root/large_tool_results/<tool-id> with head/tail preview in tool message.",
