      "id": "claim_1a23a2ece5a040ef96e1baea7c39b28c",
      "statement": "SandboxIntegrationTests uses sandbox_test_root fixture (autouse=True) to create isolated per-test directories, keyed to request.node.name. sandbox_path() helper builds absolute paths under sandbox_root_dir (/tmp/test_sandbox_ops/ by default). has_sync and has_async properties control test execution; tests skip if unsupported.",
